                "retweet_count": 95,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicare and Medicaid are a lifeline for seniors, families, veterans, and people with disabilities. But House Republicans voted to slash this lifeline for more than 15 million Americans. We should be strengthening Medicare and Medicaid, not ripping care away. I won\u2019t rest until we save America\u2019s health care.",
